WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.602
Shelfmark keeps every link you save in one place.

2
00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:06.440
Open the demo: no account needed.

3
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.997
Paste a link.

4
00:00:09.997 --> 00:00:18.000
The preview fills in by itself.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.192
Put it in a folder…

6
00:00:20.192 --> 00:00:22.868
…and give it a tag.

7
00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:27.237
Save it, and it lands on your shelf.

8
00:00:27.237 --> 00:00:31.728
Folders and tags keep the shelf in order.

9
00:00:31.728 --> 00:00:41.002
A tag gathers its links from every folder.

10
00:00:41.002 --> 00:00:42.173
Need it again? Tap Search.

11
00:00:42.173 --> 00:00:47.338
Search finds titles, notes, folders and tags.

12
00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:50.838
Shelfmark. Every link, back within reach.
